  * The EFF long wordlist (CC BY 3.0), when present. It is not vendored in this
    repository; see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.


WHERE THIS FILE LIVES IN A BUILT INSTALL
---------------------------------------

The Windows installers place this file, LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md next to
the executable in the installation directory, so the attribution travels with the
software rather than only with the source tree. They are declared as
`bundle.resources` in src-tauri/tauri.conf.json.

Anyone redistributing a build should keep all three together.
